1795385864734123	codex-groom	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-2vj	{"field":"description","value":"# Context\nThe M2 packages were filed at work-package level from plan revision 5, before any code or measurement existed. Splitting them earlier would have meant guessing.\n\n# Do\nAfter M1.9: go through M2.1 to M2.10, apply what M1 and the cold-agent trial changed, and split remaining large packages into small or medium children with observable acceptance. Keep or revise the existing reporting and durability children. Identify the bone that supplies each retained invariant and fixture check before closing this review.\n\n# Acceptance\n- [ ] Every M2 package is either small enough to do as filed or has child bones.\n- [ ] Packages the evidence no longer supports are closed with a comment that says why.\n"}	blake3:LFfKFmOCU8n_SzJmNGFmx6zM63zVwXJEzJ1RdnlMQB0
