1795387075477788	gauntlet-dev	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-38z	{"description":"# Context\nM2 is the first useful product and may ship as an HTTP-scoped preview (plan §12.1). M1.8 updates the README for the M1 surface, and M5.4 is the release documentation. Before this bone, nothing kept the user-facing documentation in step with what M2 delivers.\n\n# Do\n- README: status, roadmap and examples match what M2 shipped. Commands that do not exist yet are marked with their milestone.\n- A generated command reference, and the generated error and exit-code table (M1.2.2).\n- One guide per shipped oracle in the §6.5 form: the first from M1.5.8, the second from M2.1.\n- A plain statement of what shared custody does not prevent and what isolated custody requires, with the isolated tier's printed setup commands (INV-43).\n- How to read a report and run `bundle check`, from M2.5.4.\n\n# Acceptance\n- [ ] Every example in the README and docs/ runs in the M1.12 documentation check on a fresh demo.\n- [ ] Help and docs advertise only implemented capability (INV-34).\n\nRefs: notes/plan.md §6.7, §12.1; INV-34, INV-43; notes/plan.later.md §4.\n","kind":"task","labels":["docs","m2"],"parent":"bn-i1o","size":"m","title":"M2.12 Documentation for the HTTP preview"}	blake3:noxnvbM432TdRvJZAvIXg49JFPAMdZbyyFCukFxLaaE
